ription\": \"Clean and slice the mushrooms.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Onion\", \"description\": \"Cook chopped onion until soft.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add tomatoes and green chilli.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Mushrooms\", \"description\": \"Add mushrooms and cook until tender.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Finish Curry\", \"description\": \"Add coconut milk and simmer before serving.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(39,3,'Vegetable Stew','vegetable-stew','A mild and creamy vegetable stew prepared with coconut milk.',15,25,4,'vegstew.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/-NSppaoxGwY','Cook the vegetables gently and add coconut milk to prepare a mild and creamy stew.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Vegetables\", \"description\": \"Wash and cut all the vegetables.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Vegetables\", \"description\": \"Cook the vegetables until tender.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Coconut Milk\", \"description\": \"Add coconut milk to the cooked vegetables.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Simmer\", \"description\": \"Simmer gently until the flavors combine.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve warm with suitable bread or rice.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(40,3,'Stuffed Bell Peppers','stuffed-bell-peppers','Colorful bell peppers filled with a flavorful vegetable and rice mixture.',20,30,4,'bellpepper.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/w1a1TM30lrg','Prepare a vegetable and rice filling, stuff it inside bell peppers and cook until tender.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Peppers\", \"description\": \"Wash the bell peppers and remove the tops and seeds.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Filling\", \"description\": \"Mix cooked rice with vegetables.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Stuff Peppers\", \"description\": \"Fill each bell pepper with the prepared mixture.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Cheese\", \"de