g and place it inside taco shells with fresh toppings.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Filling\", \"description\": \"Cook beans with chopped vegetables.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Toppings\", \"description\": \"Chop tomato, onion and capsicum.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Heat Shells\", \"description\": \"Warm the taco shells.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Fill Tacos\", \"description\": \"Add the bean and vegetable filling.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Add cheese and fresh toppings before serving.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(44,3,'Burrito','burrito','A soft tortilla wrap filled with rice, beans, vegetables and cheese.',15,15,4,'burrito.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/dzfQU3mXFSw','Prepare the rice and bean filling, place it inside tortillas and roll them into burritos.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Rice\", \"description\": \"Cook and prepare the rice.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Filling\", \"description\": \"Cook beans with vegetables.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Warm Tortilla\", \"description\": \"Warm the tortillas gently.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Fill and Roll\", \"description\": \"Add rice, beans, vegetables and cheese, then roll tightly.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve the burrito warm.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(45,3,'Falafel Wrap','falafel-wrap','A flavorful wrap filled with falafel, fresh vegetables and a creamy sauce.',20,20,4,'falafel-wrap-2.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/U9fhx1odgHA','Prepare chickpea falafel, cook until golden and place them inside wrap bread with fresh vegetables and yogurt sauce.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Chickpeas\", \"description\": \"Soak and prepare the chickpeas for the falafel mixture.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Make Falafel\", \"description\": \"Shape the mixture into small falafel pieces.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Cook Falafel\", \"description\": \"Cook the falafel until completely done and golden.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Wrap\", \"description\": \"Place vegetables and falafel inside the wrap bread.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Add yogurt sauce, roll the wrap and serve.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(46,4,'Samosa','samosa','A crispy and flavorful snack filled with spiced potatoes and peas.',25,20,4,'samosa.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/cN7paRwBbrY','Prepare a soft dough and fill it with a spiced potato and pea mixture before cooking until crisp.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Dough\", \"description\": \"Mix flour with water and prepare a soft dough.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Filling\", \"description\": \"Cook mashed potatoes with peas, onion and green chilli.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Shape Samosa\", \"description\": \"Roll the dough and shape it into samosa cones.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Filling\", \"description\": \"Fill each cone with the prepared potato mixture.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook the samosas until crisp and golden.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(47,4,'Pakora','pakora','Crispy vegetable fritters made with gram flour and fresh vegetables.',15,15,4,'pakora.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/qfZ3axZV48A','Mix vegetables with gram flour and prepare small portions before cooking until crisp.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Vegetables\", \"description\": \"Slice onion and potato into thin pieces.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Batter\", \"description\": \"Mix gram flour with vegetables and a little water.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Make Portions\", \"description\": \"Take small portions of the mixture.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook until the pakoras become crisp and golden.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with a suitable dip.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(48,4,'Murukku','mu