\", \"description\": \"Mash the vegetables and mix well.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Shape Cutlets\", \"description\": \"Shape the mixture into flat cutlets.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Coat\", \"description\": \"Coat the cutlets with bread crumbs.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook until golden and crisp.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(51,4,'Spring Rolls','spring-rolls','Crispy rolls filled with colorful vegetables.',25,15,4,'spring.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/wNB05Zc4TqA','Prepare a vegetable filling, place it inside spring roll sheets and cook until crisp.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Vegetables\", \"description\": \"Slice cabbage, carrot and capsicum.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Filling\", \"description\": \"Cook the vegetables with spring onion and soy sauce.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Fill Sheets\", \"description\": \"Place the vegetable mixture inside spring roll sheets.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Roll\", \"description\": \"Fold and roll the sheets tightly.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook until golden and crisp.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(52,4,'French Fries','french-fries','Crispy golden potato fries that make a simple and tasty snack.',15,15,4,'fries.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/BCFoDfESF3Y','Cut potatoes into thin strips and cook until crisp and golden.','[{\"title\": \"Cut Potatoes\", \"description\": \"Wash and cut potatoes into thin strips.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Soak\", \"description\": \"Soak the potato strips in water briefly.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Dry\", \"description\": \"Drain and dry the potato strips.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook until crisp and golden.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve warm.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(53,4,'Corn Cheese Balls','corn-cheese-balls','Crispy snack balls filled with sweet cor