er.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Coconut\", \"description\": \"Mix in fresh grated coconut.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve warm.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(98,7,'Vatha Kuzhambu','vatha-kuzhambu','A tangy and flavorful traditional Tamil Nadu curry made with tamarind.',15,25,4,'vathakolambu.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/JgH5UvCNhX8','Prepare a tamarind-based gravy with vegetables and vathal.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Tamarind\", \"description\": \"Soak tamarind and extract the juice.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Shallots\", \"description\": \"Cook shallots until soft.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Vathal\", \"description\": \"Add vathal and cook briefly.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Gravy\", \"description\": \"Add tamarind water and simmer.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Cook until flavorful and serve with rice.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(99,7,'Kathirikai Kara Kuzhambu','kathirikai-kara-kuzhambu','A spicy and tangy brinjal curry prepared with tamarind and flavorful ingredients.',15,25,4,'kathirikai.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/mBzvdBqrW1A','Cook brinjal in a tangy tamarind gravy until tender.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Brinjal\", \"description\": \"Wash and cut the brinjal.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Onion\", \"description\": \"Cook onion until soft.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add chopped tomatoes.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Gravy\", \"description\": \"Add tamarind water and brinjal.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Simmer until the brinjal is tender.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(100,7,'Vegetable Kurma','vegetable-kurma','A creamy mixed vegetable curry prepared with coconut and flavorful ingredients.',20,30,4,'veg-kurma.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/a4SEVGIOsqM','Cook mixed vegetables in a creamy coconut-based gravy.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Vegetables\", \"description\": \"Wash and cut the vegetables.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Onion\", \"description\": \"Cook onion until soft.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add chopped tomatoes.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Vegetables\", \"description\": \"Add vegetables and cook until tender.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Finish Kurma\", \"description\": \"Add coconut mixture and simmer.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(101,7,'Dal Makhani','dal-makhani','A rich and creamy lentil dish prepared with black lentils and kidney beans.',20,40,4,'makani.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/ca51e7nMI2g','Cook lentils until soft and prepare a rich tomato-based creamy gravy.','[{\"title\": \"Soak Lentils\", \"description\": \"Soak black lentils and kidney beans.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Lentils\", \"description\": \"Cook them until completely soft.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Gravy\", \"description\": \"Cook tomatoes until soft.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Combine\", \"description\": \"Add cooked lentils to the gravy.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Finish\", \"description\": \"Add butter and cream and simmer.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(102,7,'Malai Kofta','malai-kofta','Soft vegetable and paneer dumplings served in a creamy gravy.',25,30,4,'malaikofta.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/c8Lh4vzSQG0','Prepare soft paneer and potato dumplings and serve them with creamy gravy.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Mixture\", \"description\": \"Mash paneer and potatoes together.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Shape Kofta\", \"description\": \"Shape the mixture into small balls.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Gravy\", \"description\": \"Cook onion and tomato into a smooth gravy.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Cream\", \"description\": \"Add cream to the gravy.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"descrip