n until soft.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add tomatoes and green chilli.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Chickpeas\", \"description\": \"Add cooked chickpeas to the gravy.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Simmer and garnish with coriander.\", \"step_number\": 5}]'),(106,8,'Chicken 65','chicken-65','A crispy and spicy South Indian chicken starter.',20,20,3,'65.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/-HPRM7b3r4Q','Marinate chicken with curd, spices and flour, then fry until crispy.','[{\"title\": \"Clean Chicken\", \"description\": \"Wash and drain the chicken pieces.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Marinade\", \"description\": \"Mix curd, ginger-garlic paste, chilli powder, cornflour, rice flour and salt.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Marinate\", \"description\": \"Add chicken and marinate for 20 minutes.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Heat Oil\", \"description\": \"Heat oil in a pan.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Fry Chicken\", \"description\": \"Fry the chicken until golden and fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with lemon wedges.\", \"step_number\": 6}]'),(107,8,'Chicken Chettinad','chicken-chettinad','A traditional Chettinad chicken curry with roasted spices and coconut.',20,40,4,'chettinad.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/c7CqaRmVa5g','Cook chicken in a traditional Chettinad masala prepared with roasted coconut and spices.','[{\"title\": \"Roast Spices\", \"description\": \"Roast coconut, fennel seeds and pepper, then grind into a paste.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Sauté Onion\", \"description\": \"Heat oil and sauté onions and curry leaves.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Ginger-Garlic\", \"description\": \"Add ginger-garlic paste and cook briefly.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add chopped tomatoes and cook until soft.\", \"ste