oes, curd and biryani masala.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Cook Mutton\", \"description\": \"Add mutton, mint, coriander leaves and salt.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Tenderize\", \"description\": \"Cook the mutton until tender.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Add Rice\", \"description\": \"Add soaked rice and the required amount of water.\", \"step_number\": 6}, {\"title\": \"Cook Biryani\", \"description\": \"Cover and cook until the rice is soft and fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 7}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Gently mix and serve hot.\", \"step_number\": 8}]'),(110,8,'Fish Fry','fish-fry','Crispy fish slices coated with a spicy South Indian masala.',15,15,3,'fishfry.webp','https://www.youtube.com/embed/o8lDCY2_jyw','Marinate fish slices with spices and shallow-fry until cooked.','[{\"title\": \"Clean Fish\", \"description\": \"Wash the fish slices and drain well.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Masala\", \"description\": \"Mix chilli powder, turmeric, coriander powder, ginger-garlic paste, lemon juice and salt.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Marinate\", \"description\": \"Apply the masala to the fish and rest for 15 minutes.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Heat Pan\", \"description\": \"Heat oil in a frying pan.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Fry Fish\", \"description\": \"Fry the fish on both sides until fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with lemon and onion slices.\", \"step_number\": 6}]'),(111,8,'Fish Tikka','fish-tikka','Tender fish pieces marinated in curd and spices, then grilled.',25,20,3,'Fish-Tikka.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/eFSauc959XE','Marinate fish cubes in a spiced curd mixture and grill until cooked.','[{\"title\": \"Cut Fish\", \"description\": \"Cut boneless fish into medium-sized cubes.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Marinade\", \"description\": \"Mix curd, chilli powder, turmeric, garam ma