}, {\"title\": \"Marinate\", \"description\": \"Add prawns and marinate for 15 minutes.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Heat Oil\", \"description\": \"Heat oil in a pan.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Fry Prawns\", \"description\": \"Fry the prawns, stirring occasionally, until fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with lemon wedges.\", \"step_number\": 6}]'),(114,8,'Crab Masala','crab-masala','Crab cooked in a traditional masala with onions, tomatoes and spices.',25,30,3,'crab.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/l6vdzhTUTrc','Cook cleaned crab with onion-tomato masala and spices until fully cooked.','[{\"title\": \"Clean Crab\", \"description\": \"Clean the crab thoroughly.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Sauté Onion\", \"description\": \"Heat oil and sauté onions with curry leaves.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Paste\", \"description\": \"Add ginger-garlic paste and cook briefly.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add tomatoes and cook until soft.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Add Spices\", \"description\": \"Add chilli powder, coriander powder, turmeric and salt.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Cook Crab\", \"description\": \"Add crab and a little water, then cover and cook until fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 6}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with rice or roti.\", \"step_number\": 7}]'),(115,8,'Chicken Kebab','chicken-kebab','Juicy chicken kebabs marinated with curd, herbs and spices.',30,20,3,'kebab.webp','https://www.youtube.com/embed/fIeCfffQ5IM','Marinate chicken pieces with curd and spices, then grill until cooked.','[{\"title\": \"Cut Chicken\", \"description\": \"Cut chicken into medium-sized pieces.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Marinade\", \"description\": \"Mix curd, ginger-garlic paste, chilli powder, garam masala, lemon juice and salt.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Marinate\", \"description\": \"Add chicken and marinate for 30 minutes.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Arrange\", \"description\": \"Thread chicken pieces onto skewers.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Grill\", \"description\": \"Grill or bake until thoroughly cooked, turning occasionally.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with mint chutney.\", \"step_number\": 6}]'),(116,8,'Mutton Kebab','mutton-kebab','Spiced minced mutton shaped into kebabs and cooked until tender.',25,25,3,'mkebab.webp','https://www.youtube.com/embed/tVf043w3Xn4','Mix minced mutton with onions and spices, shape into kebabs and cook thoroughly.','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Mixture\", \"description\": \"Combine minced mutton, finely chopped onion and ginger-garlic paste.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Spices\", \"description\": \"Add chilli powder, garam masala, coriander leaves and salt.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Shape Kebabs\", \"description\": \"Mix well and shape into kebabs.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Heat Pan\", \"description\": \"Heat a lightly oiled pan or grill.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Cook Kebabs\", \"description\": \"Cook the kebabs, turning regularly, until fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with chutney.\", \"step_number\": 6}]'),(117,8,'Egg Masala','egg-masala','Boiled eggs simmered in a rich and spicy tomato gravy.',10,20,3,'EggMasala4.webp','https://www.youtube.com/embed/jq9JL9L6sbI','Prepare a spicy onion-tomato gravy and simmer boiled eggs in it.','[{\"title\": \"Boil Eggs\", \"description\": \"Boil the eggs, peel them and make small slits.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Sauté Onion\", \"description\": \"Heat oil and sauté chopped onions.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Paste\", \"description\": \"Add ginger-garlic paste and cook.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add tomatoes and cook until soft.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Add Spices\", \"description\": \"Add chilli powder, coriander powder, turmeric and salt.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Gravy\", \"description\": \"Add a little water and simmer until the gravy thickens.\", \"step_number\": 6}, {\"title\": \"Add Eggs\", \"description\": \"Add boiled eggs and cook for a few minutes.\", \"step_number\": 7}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with rice or chapati.\", \"step_number\": 8}]'),(118,8,'Fish Molee','fish-molee','A Kerala-style fish curry prepared with coconut milk and mild spices.',15,25,3,'Fish-Molee.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/cJJbvDywDfY','Simmer fish in a mild coconut milk gravy with ginger, green chillies and curry leaves.','[{\"title\": \"Clean Fish\", \"description\": \"Wash the fish pieces and drain well.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Sauté Aromatics\", \"description\": \"Heat oil and sauté ginger, green chillies and curry leaves.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Onion\", \"description\": \"Add sliced onion and cook until soft.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add tomato, turmeric and salt.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Gravy\", \"description\": \"Add a little water and simmer.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Cook Fish\", \"description\": \"Add fish and cook gently until nearly done.\", \"step_number\": 6}, {\"title\": \"Add Coconut Milk\", \"description\": \"Add coconut milk and simmer on low heat until the fish is fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 7}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve warm with rice or appam.\", \"step_number\": 8}]'),(119,8,'Chicken Saag','chicken-saag','Chicken cooked with spinach, tomatoes and aromatic spices.',20,35,4,'saag.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/IWCYQK2ij5g','Cook chicken in a spiced gravy with spinach puree until tender.','[{\"title\": \"Wash Spinach\", \"description\": \"Wash spinach thoroughly.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Puree\", \"description\": \"Cook spinach briefly and blend into a puree.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Sauté Onion\", \"description\": \"Heat oil and add cumin seeds, then sauté onions.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Paste\", \"description\": \"Add ginger-garlic paste and cook.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Add Tomato\", \"description\": \"Add tomatoes, coriander powder, turmeric and salt.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Cook Chicken\", \"description\": \"Add chicken and a little water, then cook until nearly done.\", \"step_number\": 6}, {\"title\": \"Add Spinach\", \"description\": \"Stir in spinach puree and simmer until the chicken is fully cooked.\", \"step_number\": 7}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with roti or rice.\", \"step_number\": 8}]'),(120,8,'Mutton Sukka','mutton-sukka','A traditional South Indian dry mutton dish with roasted spices and curry leaves.',20,45,4,'mutton-chukka.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/w9XI7QhuA4U','Pressure-cook mutton until tender, then roast it with onions, curry leaves and spices until dry.','[{\"title\": \"Clean Mutton\", \"description\": \"Wash the mutton and drain excess water.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Pressure-Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook mutton with turmeric, salt and a little water until tender.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Sauté Spices\", \"description\": \"Heat oil in a pan and add fennel seeds and curry leaves.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Onion\", \"description\": \"Add chopped onions and ginger-garlic paste and sauté.\", \"step_number\": 4}, {\"title\": \"Add Masala\", \"description\": \"Add chilli powder and coriander powder.\", \"step_number\": 5}, {\"title\": \"Add Mutton\", \"description\": \"Add the cooked mutton and mix well.\", \"step_number\": 6}, {\"title\": \"Roast\", \"description\": \"Cook uncovered until the moisture evaporates and the masala coats the mutton.\", \"step_number\": 7}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with rice or parotta.\", \"step_number\": 8}]'),(121,9,'Bisi Bele Bath','bisi-bele-bath','A flavorful Karnataka rice dish prepared with rice, lentils, vegetables and spices.',15,35,4,'bisi.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/V5qvCn08d58','','[{\"title\": \"Cook Rice and Dal\", \"description\": \"Cook rice and toor dal until soft.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Vegetables\", \"description\": \"Cook the vegetables separately until tender.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Masala\", \"description\": \"Mix vegetables with tamarind and bisi bele bath powder.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Combine\", \"description\": \"Add cooked rice and dal and mix well.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(122,9,'Mysore Masala Dosa','mysore-masala-dosa','Crispy dosa filled with spicy potato masala and Mysore-style chutney.',15,20,3,'mysore.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/e9XFHjdw3Cg','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Masala\", \"description\": \"Cook mashed potatoes with onion, chilli and spices.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Heat Tawa\", \"description\": \"Heat a dosa tawa over medium heat.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Make Dosa\", \"description\": \"Spread dosa batter thinly on the tawa.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Filling\", \"description\": \"Spread chutney and add potato masala before folding.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(123,9,'Ragi Mudde','ragi-mudde','A traditional Karnataka dish made with ragi flour and water.',10,15,3,'mudde.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/9Oywa7T6FY4','','[{\"title\": \"Boil Water\", \"description\": \"Bring water to a boil with a little salt.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Flour\", \"description\": \"Add ragi flour gradually without forming lumps.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook while stirring until the mixture becomes thick.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Shape\", \"description\": \"Allow it to cool slightly and shape into balls.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(124,9,'Akki Roti','akki-roti','A soft and flavorful Karnataka flatbread made with rice flour.',15,20,3,'akki.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/-cwXQ3z22dM','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Dough\", \"description\": \"Mix rice flour with onion, chilli, coconut and water.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Shape\", \"description\": \"Spread the dough into a thin round shape.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook on a heated tawa until both sides are cooked.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve hot with chutney or curry.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(125,9,'Puttu with Kadala Curry','puttu-kadala-curry','A traditional Kerala breakfast pairing steamed rice puttu with black chickpea curry.',20,30,4,'puttu.webp','https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rr72jCYwMdc','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Puttu\", \"description\": \"Mix rice flour with water and steam with grated coconut.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Chickpeas\", \"description\": \"Cook soaked black chickpeas until tender.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Curry\", \"description\": \"Cook onion, tomato and spices and add chickpeas.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve warm puttu with kadala curry.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(126,9,'Kerala Parotta with Veg Curry','kerala-parotta-veg-curry','Layered Kerala-style parotta served with a flavorful vegetable curry.',25,30,4,'kerala.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/BD7wsI61lHQ','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Dough\", \"description\": \"Make a soft dough using flour and water.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Parotta\", \"description\": \"Shape and cook the layered parotta on a tawa.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Make Curry\", \"description\": \"Cook vegetables with onion, tomato and spices.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Finish\", \"description\": \"Add coconut milk and cook gently before serving.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(127,9,'Kallappam','kallappam','A soft Kerala rice pancake with a mildly fermented flavour.',20,20,4,'appam.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/XF5zLP57rw0','','[{\"title\": \"Soak Rice\", \"description\": \"Soak rice and grind it with coconut and cooked rice.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Ferment\", \"description\": \"Add yeast and allow the batter to ferment.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Heat Pan\", \"description\": \"Heat a lightly greased pan.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Pour batter and cook until the appam is soft and cooked.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(128,9,'Theeyal','theeyal','A traditional Kerala curry prepared with roasted coconut and tamarind.',15,25,4,'theeyal.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/2vNm4mGH1-Q','','[{\"title\": \"Roast Coconut\", \"description\": \"Roast coconut with spices until aromatic.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Grind\", \"description\": \"Grind the roasted mixture into a paste.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Curry\", \"description\": \"Cook onions with tamarind water.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Combine\", \"description\": \"Add the coconut paste and simmer until well combined.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(129,9,'Pulihora','pulihora','Tangy and flavorful tamarind rice popular in Andhra cuisine.',10,20,4,'pulisadham.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/ghK7c4kdyZg','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Tamarind Mix\", \"description\": \"Cook tamarind extract with turmeric and spices.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Tempering\", \"description\": \"Roast peanuts and add curry leaves and chilli.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Rice\", \"description\": \"Add cooked rice to the mixture.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Mix\", \"description\": \"Mix gently until the rice is evenly coated.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(130,9,'Gutti Vankaya Curry','gutti-vankaya-curry','Stuffed baby brinjals cooked in a rich and spicy Andhra-style gravy.',20,30,4,'gutti.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/mWRS3p_bAdw','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Filling\", \"description\": \"Grind peanuts, coconut and spices into a paste.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Stuff Brinjals\", \"description\": \"Make small cuts in the brinjals and fill them with the paste.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Cook\", \"description\": \"Cook the stuffed brinjals gently in a pan.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Add Gravy\", \"description\": \"Add tamarind water and cook until the brinjals are tender.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(131,9,'Gongura Pachadi','gongura-pachadi','A tangy Andhra chutney made using gongura leaves and spices.',10,15,4,'gongura-pachadi.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/LcDpqnOeyLM','','[{\"title\": \"Cook Gongura\", \"description\": \"Cook gongura leaves until they become soft.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Roast Spices\", \"description\": \"Roast chillies and spices until aromatic.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Grind\", \"description\": \"Grind gongura and roasted ingredients together.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Temper\", \"description\": \"Add a simple mustard and curry leaf tempering.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(132,9,'Andhra Tomato Pappu','andhra-tomato-pappu','A comforting Andhra dal prepared with tomatoes and mild spices.',10,25,4,'Tomato-Rice.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/CRsw7Yq5ADU','','[{\"title\": \"Cook Dal\", \"description\": \"Cook toor dal until soft.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Cook Tomatoes\", \"description\": \"Cook tomatoes, onion and green chilli.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Combine\", \"description\": \"Add cooked dal and turmeric.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Simmer\", \"description\": \"Simmer until the flavours combine well.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(133,9,'Kancheepuram Idli','kancheepuram-idli','A traditional Tamil Nadu idli flavored with pepper, cumin and ginger.',20,25,4,'kanchi.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/t9MLnZaI6hQ','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Batter\", \"description\": \"Mix idli batter with curd and the seasonings.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Prepare Tempering\", \"description\": \"Temper pepper, cumin, ginger and cashews.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add to Batter\", \"description\": \"Mix the tempering into the batter.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Steam\", \"description\": \"Pour into molds and steam until completely cooked.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(134,9,'Paruppu Usili','paruppu-usili','A traditional Tamil Nadu dish made with steamed lentil crumble and vegetables.',20,25,4,'usili.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/zG03jy9ahp4','','[{\"title\": \"Soak Dal\", \"description\": \"Soak the dals and grind them with chillies.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Steam\", \"description\": \"Steam the ground dal mixture until firm.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Crumble\", \"description\": \"Crumble the steamed dal mixture.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Combine\", \"description\": \"Cook beans and mix with the dal crumble.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(135,9,'Thengai Sadam','thengai-sadam','Simple and aromatic coconut rice prepared with freshly grated coconut.',10,15,3,'coconut-rice.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/h72FPP089pg','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Tempering\", \"description\": \"Heat oil and add mustard seeds, chilli and curry leaves.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Coconut\", \"description\": \"Add grated coconut and sauté lightly.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Rice\", \"description\": \"Add cooked rice and mix gently.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Finish\", \"description\": \"Add roasted cashews and serve.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(136,10,'Mango Lassi','mango-lassi','A creamy and refreshing yogurt-based mango drink.',10,0,2,'mango-lassi-recipe.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/AMKoec4Ueo0','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Mango\", \"description\": \"Peel and cut the mango into pieces.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Blend\", \"description\": \"Add mango, yogurt, milk and sugar to a blender.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Flavour\", \"description\": \"Add cardamom and blend until smooth.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Pour into glasses and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(137,10,'Badam Milk','badam-milk','A rich and flavorful milk drink prepared with almonds and cardamom.',15,10,2,'badham.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/LrmNSksAYbE','','[{\"title\": \"Soak Almonds\", \"description\": \"Soak almonds and remove their skins.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Make Paste\", \"description\": \"Grind the almonds with a little milk.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Heat Milk\", \"description\": \"Warm milk and add the almond paste.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Finish\", \"description\": \"Add sugar, cardamom and saffron and serve warm.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(138,10,'Rose Milk','rose-milk','A sweet and refreshing milk drink with a delicate rose flavour.',5,0,2,'rose-milk-recipe-3.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/w6JW2vggG04','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Milk\", \"description\": \"Pour chilled milk into a bowl.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Rose Syrup\", \"description\": \"Add rose syrup and sugar.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Mix\", \"description\": \"Stir well until evenly combined.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Add ice cubes and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(139,10,'Jal Jeera','jal-jeera','A tangy and refreshing cumin-flavoured Indian drink.',10,0,3,'jaljeera.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/J7UDjNVxUFw','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Mint\", \"description\": \"Blend mint leaves with a little water.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Mix\", \"description\": \"Combine mint water with the remaining water.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Flavours\", \"description\": \"Add cumin powder, lemon juice and black salt.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Mix well and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(140,10,'Aam Panna','aam-panna','A tangy raw mango drink flavored with cumin and mint.',10,15,3,'aampaana.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/OwXH_tXSwl8','','[{\"title\": \"Cook Mango\", \"description\": \"Cook raw mangoes until they become soft.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Extract Pulp\", \"description\": \"Remove the pulp and mash it.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Mix\", \"description\": \"Add sugar, cumin powder and mint.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Mix with chilled water and serve.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(141,10,'Nannari Sharbat','nannari-sharbat','A traditional summer drink made with aromatic nannari syrup.',5,0,2,'sarbath.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/WMNx0Auo-Io','','[{\"title\": \"Add Syrup\", \"description\": \"Add nannari syrup to a glass.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Water\", \"description\": \"Pour chilled water over the syrup.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Lemon\", \"description\": \"Add fresh lemon juice.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Mix well and serve with ice.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(142,10,'Panakam','panakam','A traditional South Indian jaggery drink flavored with ginger and cardamom.',10,0,3,'panakam-Recipe.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/ChxClGKMsWY','','[{\"title\": \"Dissolve Jaggery\", \"description\": \"Mix jaggery with water until dissolved.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Spices\", \"description\": \"Add dry ginger powder and crushed cardamom.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Lemon\", \"description\": \"Add lemon juice and mix.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Strain if needed and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(143,10,'Tender Coconut Water','tender-coconut-water','A naturally refreshing drink served directly from tender coconut.',5,0,1,'coco.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/u2oq24OokLI','','[{\"title\": \"Open Coconut\", \"description\": \"Carefully open the tender coconut.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Collect Water\", \"description\": \"Pour the coconut water into a glass.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Coconut\", \"description\": \"Add some tender coconut flesh if desired.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve fresh.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(144,10,'Sugarcane Juice','sugarcane-juice','A naturally sweet and refreshing juice made from fresh sugarcane.',10,0,2,'sugar.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/XwvbGIYORcQ','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Juice\", \"description\": \"Use freshly extracted sugarcane juice.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Ginger\", \"description\": \"Add a small amount of crushed ginger.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Lemon\", \"description\": \"Add lemon juice for freshness.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Mix well and serve immediately.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(145,10,'Watermelon Juice','watermelon-juice','A light and refreshing summer drink made with fresh watermelon.',10,0,2,'watermelon.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/4CJAHF9LK-8','','[{\"title\": \"Cut Watermelon\", \"description\": \"Remove the rind and cut the watermelon into pieces.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Blend\", \"description\": \"Blend the watermelon until smooth.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Lemon\", \"description\": \"Add lemon juice and mix.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Garnish with mint and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(146,10,'Pineapple Juice','pineapple-juice','A sweet and tangy tropical drink made with fresh pineapple.',10,0,2,'pinejuice.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/Zldotrfh_Xk','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Pineapple\", \"description\": \"Peel and cut pineapple into small pieces.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Blend\", \"description\": \"Blend pineapple with water.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Lemon\", \"description\": \"Add lemon juice and mix.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Strain if desired and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(147,10,'Orange Juice','orange-juice','A fresh citrus drink prepared from ripe oranges.',10,0,2,'orangejuice.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/w6IjwKOB_t8','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Oranges\", \"description\": \"Wash and cut the oranges.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Extract Juice\", \"description\": \"Squeeze the oranges or use a juicer.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Strain\", \"description\": \"Strain the juice if desired.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Serve fresh and chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(148,10,'Lemon Mint Cooler','lemon-mint-cooler','A refreshing lemon drink infused with fresh mint.',10,0,2,'lime_mint_tea.avif','https://www.youtube.com/embed/_Dk3TRd9nho','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Mint\", \"description\": \"Crush mint leaves gently.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Lemon\", \"description\": \"Add fresh lemon juice.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Mix\", \"description\": \"Add water and sugar and mix well.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Add ice and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(149,10,'Ginger Tea','ginger-tea','A warm and aromatic tea infused with fresh ginger.',5,10,2,'Ginger-Tea.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZtDGYQwcBYA','','[{\"title\": \"Boil Water\", \"description\": \"Bring water to a gentle boil.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Add Ginger\", \"description\": \"Add crushed ginger and simmer briefly.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Add Tea\", \"description\": \"Add tea powder and milk.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Finish\", \"description\": \"Add sugar, strain and serve warm.\", \"step_number\": 4}]'),(150,10,'Cold Coffee','cold-coffee','A chilled creamy coffee drink perfect for a refreshing break.',5,0,2,'iced-coffee-recipe.webp','https://www.youtube.com/embed/LcSYKsdZCM8','','[{\"title\": \"Prepare Coffee\", \"description\": \"Dissolve coffee powder in a little milk.\", \"step_number\": 1}, {\"title\": \"Blend\", \"description\": \"Add cold milk, sugar and ice to a blender.\", \"step_number\": 2}, {\"title\": \"Mix\", \"description\": \"Blend until smooth and slightly frothy.\", \"step_number\": 3}, {\"title\": \"Serve\", \"description\": \"Pour into glasses and serve chilled.\", \"step_number\": 4}]');
